#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>キャンプ・ブロークングラスの派遣団の不滅隊士は、冒険者を探していたようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Ein Legionär im Camp Splitterglas ist auf der Suche nach dir.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Ce membre de la délégation des Immortels vous cherche.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzd010_04234:TEXT_AKTKZD010_04234_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>A member of the Immortal Flames is looking for a hero brave enough to wield a mighty weapon and fell a colossus."
msgstr ""

#. ja: テルティウム駅付近の派遣団の不滅隊士と話す
#. de: Mit dem Legionär in der Nähe des Bahnhofs sprechen
#. fr: Rejoindre le délégué des Immortels
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzd010_04234:TEXT_AKTKZD010_04234_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak to the Immortal Flame delegate near the station."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EObj 2011849 0>で待機して<br>魔導プラズマボールで魔導コロッサスの機能を停止させる
#. de: Am <noun-de EObj 5 2011849 1 4 1> Stellung beziehen und die Magitek-Colossi mit Plasmageschossen funktionsuntüchtig schießen
#. fr: Attendre à l'endroit indiqué et abattre les colosses magitek avec le canon à plasma magitek
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzd010_04234:TEXT_AKTKZD010_04234_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Wait at the specified location and stop the colossi with the magitek weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 派遣団の不滅隊士と話す
#. de: Mit dem Legionär sprechen
#. fr: Parler au délégué des Immortels
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzd010_04234:TEXT_AKTKZD010_04234_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Speak with the Immortal Flame delegate."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アンバガイに報告
#. de: Ambaghai Bericht erstatten
#. fr: Faire un rapport à Ambaghai
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/042/AktKzd010_04234:TEXT_AKTKZD010_04234_TODO_03:1"
msgid "Report to Ambaghai."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ああ、よかった！<br><if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if>、貴方に頼みたいことが！
#. de: <if ($gn52 > 0)><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, ein Glück, dass ich Euch treffe!
#. fr: Ne serait-ce pas <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></capitalize></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></capitalize></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></capitalize></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!! J'avais justement un service à vous demander<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FLAMESOLDIER04234
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><she… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
